### 1.Fixes issues with empty model & interface with comments inside:

```cadl
model Foo {
 // Comments
}

interface Ops {
 // Comments
}
```

would get formatted to 
```
model Foo {}
// Comments

interface Ops {}
// Comments
```

### 2.Fix crash when having a comment in an empty anonymous model

```cadl
model Foo {
 nested: {
   // This comment crash prettier as it didn't know how to render it
  }
}
```

### 3. Fix crash when having multiline comments

Having a multiline comment without each line starting with `*` would crash
```cadl
/**
 some 
comment
 */
model Foo { }
```

